  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo Civil Society Foundation program/core support 2015-2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kosovo Civil Society Foundation program/core support 2015-2018</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida support covers all KCSF core activities as laid out in the KCSF Programmatic Strategy. The overall goal of KCSF Programmatic Strategy is to enable civil society for the democratic development of Kosovo. The intended overall goal is the ultimate result of KCSF&#x2019;s theory of change, which is the overarching logic of its strategy.
On achieving the indented goal, KCSF works in three areas:
1) Competent civil society to empower citizens&apos; potential for Kosovo&apos;s democratic development;
2) Civil society initiatives and partners mobilized and supported to enhance civil society role on Kosovo&apos;s democratic development; and,
3) Evidence-based arguments produced and utilized in the policy debate on civil society development and the European integration process.</narrative>
  </description>
